    "summary": "Vessel (a) made of gourd with lid (b) made of wood. Spherical container with bulbous top; incised cross-hatched deocration in band around middle. Deep beadwork collar in white, red, green, dark and light blue and yellow glass (?) beads on fibre thread; short looped metal chain fringe. Leather carrying strap. Conical wooden stopper with pyro-engraved decoration. Covered with strings of white and red glass (?) beads.",
